# ruled unit with its heading path, location and normalised text). One row's heading path contains "phrases" and
# its text holds a 64-letter shape signature; together they match the detector's keyword + token pattern. Spec text,
# never a credential; gitleaks still scans the file (E08-D08, PR #4864's gates run).
(^|/)docs/design/_tools/e08_d08_ruled_pins\.txt$
